(6584301, 982173, 37779, '<td valign="top">I feel perhaps if this were slightly less exposed it would have a little more aesthetic to it. I can see what you were going for though and I like the idea.</td>', 'I feel perhaps if this were slightly less exposed it would have a little more aesthetic to it. I can see what you were going for though and I like the idea.', '2011-11-04 00:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
