(6585120, 982009, 59029, '<td valign="top">*waving* Hi Christophe!! See you on the front page~!<br/> <br/>And if you''re not Christophe, damn good work.</td>', '*waving* Hi Christophe!! See you on the front page~! And if you''re not Christophe, damn good work.', '2011-11-04 15:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585121, 982194, 16106, '<td valign="top">It seems to me that there is too much blanket here, and that all the interest is crowded into the upper quarter of the image. It hurts what ought to be a much better entry.</td>', 'It seems to me that there is too much blanket here, and that all the interest is crowded into the upper quarter of the image. It hurts what ought to be a much better entry.', '2011-11-04 15:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585122, 982226, 16106, '<td valign="top">very funny take.</td>', 'very funny take.', '2011-11-04 15:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585128, 981928, 16106, '<td valign="top">nice set up and technicals but the models expression (and the flat documentary lighting) seem more in keeping with the boredom of demolition than the horror of being sealed within a wall.</td>', 'nice set up and technicals but the models expression (and the flat documentary lighting) seem more in keeping with the boredom of demolition than the horror of being sealed within a wall.', '2011-11-04 15:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585130, 981573, 30214, '<td valign="top">pretty well done creative edit (not quite clear where the bright sunlight comes from, but that''s a minor detail, probably irrelevant in a dreamland :))</td>', 'pretty well done creative edit (not quite clear where the bright sunlight comes from, but that''s a minor detail, probably irrelevant in a dreamland :))', '2011-11-04 15:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585132, 982217, 30214, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and lack of boring literalism</td>', 'I like the composition and lack of boring literalism', '2011-11-04 15:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585207, 982224, 30214, '<td valign="top">lovely portrait</td>', 'lovely portrait', '2011-11-04 16:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585208, 982234, 30214, '<td valign="top">wow, that is some plunge! nice image!</td>', 'wow, that is some plunge! nice image!', '2011-11-04 16:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585209, 982203, 30214, '<td valign="top">very dramatic, BW is a good choice.</td>', 'very dramatic, BW is a good choice.', '2011-11-04 16:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585216, 982035, 30214, '<td valign="top">nicely done. I would prefer a bit more dynamic composition and less accent on the scull, don''t worry, we would''ve noticed it anyway :)</td>', 'nicely done. I would prefer a bit more dynamic composition and less accent on the scull, don''t worry, we would''ve noticed it anyway :)', '2011-11-04 16:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585217, 982206, 30214, '<td valign="top">beautiful toning, and I am glad that it is not as literal as most of the entries</td>', 'beautiful toning, and I am glad that it is not as literal as most of the entries', '2011-11-04 16:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585218, 981774, 30214, '<td valign="top">very interesting, dynamic abstract. well done.</td>', 'very interesting, dynamic abstract. well done.', '2011-11-04 16:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585220, 981202, 30214, '<td valign="top">yes, it''s black for sure :)</td>', 'yes, it''s black for sure :)', '2011-11-04 16:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585221, 982256, 30214, '<td valign="top">interesting interpretation.</td>', 'interesting interpretation.', '2011-11-04 16:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585236, 981573, 114969, '<td valign="top">Wow, now that''s impressive. I really like it, the composition, scenery, atmosphere, are all fantastic. The one thing I don''t like is the sky, especially the part on the left (it''s very bright, when compared to other portions of the sky). The main subject''s shadow is probably a bit too hard: the ambient light would be quite diffused here, with all the fog and clouds. A fantastic job anyway!</td>', 'Wow, now that''s impressive. I really like it, the composition, scenery, atmosphere, are all fantastic. The one thing I don''t like is the sky, especially the part on the left (it''s very bright, when compared to other portions of the sky). The main subject''s shadow is probably a bit too hard: the ambient light would be quite diffused here, with all the fog and clouds. A fantastic job anyway!', '2011-11-04 17:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585237, 981771, 114969, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenery, it is an amazing photo. The tones and movements really makes it, especially with the very stoic silhouette in the middle of the elements. Great one, I just love it.</td>', 'Beautiful scenery, it is an amazing photo. The tones and movements really makes it, especially with the very stoic silhouette in the middle of the elements. Great one, I just love it.', '2011-11-04 17:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585238, 982123, 114969, '<td valign="top">The point of view really makes the photo here :) Very well done! The acting is also superb. Great job!</td>', 'The point of view really makes the photo here :) Very well done! The acting is also superb. Great job!', '2011-11-04 17:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585239, 982195, 114969, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait, I like the soft focus, I think it works well here. The only thing it lacks imho is a bigger connection with Eleonora''s story, such as a couple of lovers going away in the background, or something that would give more context, specific to Poe''s story. Very good job nonetheless!</td>', 'Very nice portrait, I like the soft focus, I think it works well here. The only thing it lacks imho is a bigger connection with Eleonora''s story, such as a couple of lovers going away in the background, or something that would give more context, specific to Poe''s story. Very good job nonetheless!', '2011-11-04 17:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585241, 982143, 114969, '<td valign="top">Very very nice. Your photo evokes fear really well.I don''t think there is much fear in this Poe''s poem, but this feeling is very present in his overall work, so it doesn''t bother me much. The lighting is excellent. The only thing I would improve is the background: the fabric wrinkles are a bit disturbing.</td>', 'Very very nice. Your photo evokes fear really well.I don''t think there is much fear in this Poe''s poem, but this feeling is very present in his overall work, so it doesn''t bother me much. The lighting is excellent. The only thing I would improve is the background: the fabric wrinkles are a bit disturbing.', '2011-11-04 17:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585242, 982250, 114969, '<td valign="top">Very nice one! Great job! I love how your picture evoke the whole story of Vondervotteimittiss. The light on the house is perhaps a bit flat, and the colors in the sky a bit saturated, but it doesn''t bother me much.</td>', 'Very nice one! Great job! I love how your picture evoke the whole story of Vondervotteimittiss. The light on the house is perhaps a bit flat, and the colors in the sky a bit saturated, but it doesn''t bother me much.', '2011-11-04 17:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585243, 982004, 114969, '<td valign="top">I really like the painterly feeling, great work. The castle especially is very well integrated in the scene, and the dark colors really adds to the atmosphere.</td>', 'I really like the painterly feeling, great work. The castle especially is very well integrated in the scene, and the dark colors really adds to the atmosphere.', '2011-11-04 17:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585244, 981395, 114969, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I like how the lighting is consistent here. The weak point would probably be the Angel, since it doesn''t look at the raven, and is obviously a statue. What I usually do when using figurines or statue, is to try and texture them so that they look "realistic", at least more than the toy by itself. Good job nonetheless, I like it!</td>', 'Very nice! I like how the lighting is consistent here. The weak point would probably be the Angel, since it doesn''t look at the raven, and is obviously a statue. What I usually do when using figurines or statue, is to try and texture them so that they look "realistic", at least more than the toy by itself. Good job nonetheless, I like it!', '2011-11-04 17:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585245, 982224, 114969, '<td valign="top">Nice evocation of this poem, the model perfectly fits the role. I don''t like the texture though, I suppose it is there to add an "old" feeling, but the parallel lines are... well, too parallel for that. Also, I would have lit the face a little bit more, so that the dress was not the brightest element, grabbing probably the attention a bit much. Great job nonetheless!</td>', 'Nice evocation of this poem, the model perfectly fits the role. I don''t like the texture though, I suppose it is there to add an "old" feeling, but the parallel lines are... well, too parallel for that. Also, I would have lit the face a little bit more, so that the dress was not the brightest element, grabbing probably the attention a bit much. Great job nonetheless!', '2011-11-04 17:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585250, 981872, 114969, '<td valign="top">I think this photo doesn''t work too well for this challenge. The idea is ok, but a car, modern clothes and modern situation is probably not the best way to evoke Poe''s universe, unfortunately.</td>', 'I think this photo doesn''t work too well for this challenge. The idea is ok, but a car, modern clothes and modern situation is probably not the best way to evoke Poe''s universe, unfortunately.', '2011-11-04 17:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585256, 982029, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Very luminous light. Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful image. Very luminous light. Good luck!', '2011-11-04 17:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585257, 982140, 10848, '<td valign="top">Perfect entry for this challenge. Very well composed, the sky is amazing!</td>', 'Perfect entry for this challenge. Very well composed, the sky is amazing!', '2011-11-04 17:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585258, 981771, 10848, '<td valign="top">Outstanding image! Love the hues of blue, adds a feel of mystery to the over-all image.</td>', 'Outstanding image! Love the hues of blue, adds a feel of mystery to the over-all image.', '2011-11-04 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585287, 981795, 91342, '<td valign="top">I see a monster in the sky.  Sky dominates more than waters, title seems to support the water as dominate.  Probably doesn''t make any difference.</td>', 'I see a monster in the sky.  Sky dominates more than waters, title seems to support the water as dominate.  Probably doesn''t make any difference.', '2011-11-04 19:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
