(6585970, 982217, 103142, '<td valign="top">Extremely well done, imo. In a challenge with some truly spectacular expert editing, this one holds its own. -8-</td>', 'Extremely well done, imo. In a challenge with some truly spectacular expert editing, this one holds its own. -8-', '2011-11-05 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585971, 982009, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very fun idea -- nice on to explore. You don''t see death right away, which is great, because you feel like you''ve found a treasure when you see him. But if he''s reflected so well in the water, wouldn''t the railings be reflected as well? Still, very nice. -8-</td>', 'Very fun idea -- nice on to explore. You don''t see death right away, which is great, because you feel like you''ve found a treasure when you see him. But if he''s reflected so well in the water, wouldn''t the railings be reflected as well? Still, very nice. -8-', '2011-11-05 15:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585972, 982247, 103142, '<td valign="top">Awesome!! -8-</td>', 'Awesome!! -8-', '2011-11-05 15:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585973, 982195, 103142, '<td valign="top">Incredibly beautiful!</td>', 'Incredibly beautiful!', '2011-11-05 15:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585974, 982202, 103142, '<td valign="top">Wasn''t sure I liked the editing on the person. The forehead seems to take over the shot. And the sharpness of the mind vs the soft grittiness of the face seems to interrupt the flow and bring the focus more to the face than the mind. (also, the hands in the background are really dark. I''ve looked through this challenge about 5 times before voting and never noticed the hands.) I wish the darks either weren''t as dark, or the hightlights were taken down a bit so that it flowed together a little more.<br/> <br/>However, that all being said, I like the idea, I like the crop on the face with just the eyes at the bottom, and I like that there''s a lot to explore. :)  -7-</td>', 'Wasn''t sure I liked the editing on the person. The forehead seems to take over the shot. And the sharpness of the mind vs the soft grittiness of the face seems to interrupt the flow and bring the focus more to the face than the mind. (also, the hands in the background are really dark. I''ve looked through this challenge about 5 times before voting and never noticed the hands.) I wish the darks either weren''t as dark, or the hightlights were taken down a bit so that it flowed together a little more. However, that all being said, I like the idea, I like the crop on the face with just the eyes at the bottom, and I like that there''s a lot to explore. :)  -7-', '2011-11-05 15:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6586023, 981743, 62249, '<td valign="top">This is eerily appealing. Love the color palette and the graphic look of the grass and reflections.</td>', 'This is eerily appealing. Love the color palette and the graphic look of the grass and reflections.', '2011-11-05 18:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6586024, 982191, 62249, '<td valign="top">Cool. Love the curvy trees, and the smoke skull is well done. Lots of nice little Poe-ish touches in this one.</td>', 'Cool. Love the curvy trees, and the smoke skull is well done. Lots of nice little Poe-ish touches in this one.', '2011-11-05 18:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6586027, 982207, 62249, '<td valign="top">This is wonderfully creepy. I like the shadow, the blur, and the grain.</td>', 'This is wonderfully creepy. I like the shadow, the blur, and the grain.', '2011-11-05 18:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6586028, 982256, 62249, '<td valign="top">Clever.</td>', 'Clever.', '2011-11-05 18:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6586029, 982206, 62249, '<td valign="top">This is nice. Would''ve been even stronger if you''d added a hint of the ghostly figure of Annabel Lee.</td>', 'This is nice. Would''ve been even stronger if you''d added a hint of the ghostly figure of Annabel Lee.', '2011-11-05 18:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6586030, 982202, 62249, '<td valign="top">The individual elements are good and interesting, but the overall composition seems too contrived and choppy. The separate parts aren''t well integrated. 5.</td>', 'The individual elements are good and interesting, but the overall composition seems too contrived and choppy. The separate parts aren''t well integrated. 5.', '2011-11-05 18:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6586031, 982040, 62249, '<td valign="top">Looks like a scene in a stage play.</td>', 'Looks like a scene in a stage play.', '2011-11-05 18:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6586032, 981395, 62249, '<td valign="top">A little too contrived, but humorous nonetheless.</td>', 'A little too contrived, but humorous nonetheless.', '2011-11-05 18:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6586033, 982238, 62249, '<td valign="top">Looks like a steampunk holodeck. Interesting.</td>', 'Looks like a steampunk holodeck. Interesting.', '2011-11-05 18:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6586034, 981774, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like this image. The texture and contrast appeal to me, and I like the way I can interpret different areas of the image in varying ways. However, it seems shoehorned into the challenge. The only thing that ties the image to the challenge is the title. So, good image but I took off a couple of points for the shoehorn.</td>', 'I like this image. The texture and contrast appeal to me, and I like the way I can interpret different areas of the image in varying ways. However, it seems shoehorned into the challenge. The only thing that ties the image to the challenge is the title. So, good image but I took off a couple of points for the shoehorn.', '2011-11-05 18:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6586035, 981872, 62249, '<td valign="top">This could be an okay shot in some other challenge, but it doesn''t evoke the feeling of Poe''s stories. It''s just a posterized snapshot.</td>', 'This could be an okay shot in some other challenge, but it doesn''t evoke the feeling of Poe''s stories. It''s just a posterized snapshot.', '2011-11-05 18:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
