(6586927, 981414, 43463, '<td valign="top">Some of my writings cause the flesh to flush pale<br/>Six feet under vistas while alive is one such tale <br/>Interred in my grave I arise,<br/>With every reading my spirit never dies.<br/> <br/> <br/>The dark and pale colors lend to the spooky and eerie feel of the composition. Nice touch to have the ghastly hands reaching out from the grave with the name of Poe inscribed on the tombstone. It is as if Poe does indeed try to claw out from his grave much like the narrator in the his short story. Very well done.</td>', 'Some of my writings cause the flesh to flush paleSix feet under vistas while alive is one such tale Interred in my grave I arise,With every reading my spirit never dies.  The dark and pale colors lend to the spooky and eerie feel of the composition. Nice touch to have the ghastly hands reaching out from the grave with the name of Poe inscribed on the tombstone. It is as if Poe does indeed try to claw out from his grave much like the narrator in the his short story. Very well done.', '2011-11-06 22:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
