(6591326, 981414, 114969, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the "Premature Burial" photos, very nice work. I love the harmony in the tones, and the tombstones are really creepy, not mentioning the hands :-)</td>', 'My favorite of the "Premature Burial" photos, very nice work. I love the harmony in the tones, and the tombstones are really creepy, not mentioning the hands :-)', '2011-11-10 07:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591399, 982223, 43463, '<td valign="top">White patch gallows a warning of fate you fail to outrun<br/>Once I revolved around you like Pluto to the Sun<br/>But your cruelty plucked out the amber orb forever dimming my sight.<br/>To unveil the blood severed wedding vow, my wails will be your blight.<br/> <br/>Nice attention to details of the story - the elements of the brick wall behind the cat, the gallows emblazed on the chest, and the one eye all allude to Poe''s work. The biggest critique I have is that ''something'' is not quite right about the one eye aspect of the cat (and yes the composition does creep me out for the violence done to the cat and the lady in the story is unnerving). I guess it is because the plucked eye area looks flat....like the fur has grown over it.</td>', 'White patch gallows a warning of fate you fail to outrunOnce I revolved around you like Pluto to the SunBut your cruelty plucked out the amber orb forever dimming my sight.To unveil the blood severed wedding vow, my wails will be your blight. Nice attention to details of the story - the elements of the brick wall behind the cat, the gallows emblazed on the chest, and the one eye all allude to Poe''s work. The biggest critique I have is that ''something'' is not quite right about the one eye aspect of the cat (and yes the composition does creep me out for the violence done to the cat and the lady in the story is unnerving). I guess it is because the plucked eye area looks flat....like the fur has grown over it.', '2011-11-10 10:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591441, 982145, 118154, '<td valign="top">Nicely made image,works well for the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely made image,works well for the challenge.', '2011-11-10 12:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591490, 982247, 125975, '<td valign="top">How in the world did you get your dog to pose like that?  My yellow lab would never cooperate!!  Great concept and execution.</td>', 'How in the world did you get your dog to pose like that?  My yellow lab would never cooperate!!  Great concept and execution.', '2011-11-10 13:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591498, 982191, 100393, '<td valign="top">This deserves the Blue - I''m holding a very high score myself; but this is a better image.</td>', 'This deserves the Blue - I''m holding a very high score myself; but this is a better image.', '2011-11-10 13:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591531, 982192, 12611, '<td valign="top">beautiful, scary, ghostly.</td>', 'beautiful, scary, ghostly.', '2011-11-10 14:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591532, 982019, 12611, '<td valign="top">so much to process. nice feel.</td>', 'so much to process. nice feel.', '2011-11-10 14:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591534, 982178, 12611, '<td valign="top">Might fit a Robert Frost challenge as well. One of my favorites. 9</td>', 'Might fit a Robert Frost challenge as well. One of my favorites. 9', '2011-11-10 14:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591536, 982250, 12611, '<td valign="top">I see the Devil.</td>', 'I see the Devil.', '2011-11-10 14:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591537, 981573, 12611, '<td valign="top">Explosive and fire laden. Nice big scale. Great work.</td>', 'Explosive and fire laden. Nice big scale. Great work.', '2011-11-10 14:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591540, 982171, 16106, '<td valign="top">I do not know why i like this one so much. It is after all just a photo of an inanimate object, but the lighting and framing are so strong that it has been made so sinister, with the  rays of the background cloth and the strings of the puppet, and the shadows over his eyes, the over all effect is very Poe, and it is my pick for blue</td>', 'I do not know why i like this one so much. It is after all just a photo of an inanimate object, but the lighting and framing are so strong that it has been made so sinister, with the  rays of the background cloth and the strings of the puppet, and the shadows over his eyes, the over all effect is very Poe, and it is my pick for blue', '2011-11-10 14:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591541, 981974, 16106, '<td valign="top">Dreamy dread, great use of muted color and grain. Im not usually a fan of inverting the frame, but you made it work.</td>', 'Dreamy dread, great use of muted color and grain. Im not usually a fan of inverting the frame, but you made it work.', '2011-11-10 14:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591543, 982192, 16106, '<td valign="top">This lacks the darkness of tone I associate with Poe, It looks more like a Japanese folk tale where the object of fear is often very beautiful. Never the less it is in the cream of the crop for this challenge.</td>', 'This lacks the darkness of tone I associate with Poe, It looks more like a Japanese folk tale where the object of fear is often very beautiful. Never the less it is in the cream of the crop for this challenge.', '2011-11-10 14:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591544, 981795, 16106, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the tense dark textures you made here, though I do wish there was some sort of central figure, you certainly evoked the spirit of Poe.</td>', 'I enjoy the tense dark textures you made here, though I do wish there was some sort of central figure, you certainly evoked the spirit of Poe.', '2011-11-10 14:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591547, 982191, 16106, '<td valign="top">The central image is a bit over the top for Poe''s sense of vague dread, but this is beautifully done. i just wish the three elements were a bit more integrated.</td>', 'The central image is a bit over the top for Poe''s sense of vague dread, but this is beautifully done. i just wish the three elements were a bit more integrated.', '2011-11-10 14:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591550, 982127, 16106, '<td valign="top">very well lit, and nails the challenge, ought to ribbon.</td>', 'very well lit, and nails the challenge, ought to ribbon.', '2011-11-10 14:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591553, 981948, 104230, '<td valign="top">I find this over sharpened, especially affecting the leaves and the grass/gravel in the foreground.  The best part is the light on the headstones.</td>', 'I find this over sharpened, especially affecting the leaves and the grass/gravel in the foreground.  The best part is the light on the headstones.', '2011-11-10 14:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591554, 982010, 16106, '<td valign="top">A very nice composition, though I wish the bird were higher to break up the very strong line between figure and church, but you got a great mood here, even if it is  a bit more Rodger Dean than EA Poe.</td>', 'A very nice composition, though I wish the bird were higher to break up the very strong line between figure and church, but you got a great mood here, even if it is  a bit more Rodger Dean than EA Poe.', '2011-11-10 14:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591559, 982223, 16106, '<td valign="top">Very clever and quite creepy. Something about the mortar lines in the brick seems to steal a bit of the thunder from the noose, but that is a minor quibble on a shot that ought to be on the front page.</td>', 'Very clever and quite creepy. Something about the mortar lines in the brick seems to steal a bit of the thunder from the noose, but that is a minor quibble on a shot that ought to be on the front page.', '2011-11-10 14:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591560, 982254, 16106, '<td valign="top">A strong illustrative approach, but all the elements being along the top of the frame weakens the image somewhat.</td>', 'A strong illustrative approach, but all the elements being along the top of the frame weakens the image somewhat.', '2011-11-10 14:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591566, 981997, 104230, '<td valign="top">Very clever.  I like this a lot. It took a second longer that most images require to grasp, but I like that about it.  I''m a bit confused about whether that is an ax stuck in the tree or a chain, or ?</td>', 'Very clever.  I like this a lot. It took a second longer that most images require to grasp, but I like that about it.  I''m a bit confused about whether that is an ax stuck in the tree or a chain, or ?', '2011-11-10 14:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
