(6592377, 981974, 19825, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorites of the challenge. I love the tone and feel of it -- very dreamy. It did pretty well in a field with a bunch done by expert editing masters, but I ranked it higher in my voting.</td>', 'This was one of my favorites of the challenge. I love the tone and feel of it -- very dreamy. It did pretty well in a field with a bunch done by expert editing masters, but I ranked it higher in my voting.', '2011-11-11 12:37:14.000000', NULL, 0),
