(6592380, 982089, 19825, '<td valign="top">I really like this fascinating shot and thought it should have been ranked higher. I guess if you don''t do anything fancy in an Expert Editing challenge it is hard to rank higher. Regardless, on image alone this is one of the one''s I enjoyed most.</td>', 'I really like this fascinating shot and thought it should have been ranked higher. I guess if you don''t do anything fancy in an Expert Editing challenge it is hard to rank higher. Regardless, on image alone this is one of the one''s I enjoyed most.', '2011-11-11 12:41:01.000000', NULL, 0),
