(6592389, 982191, 80831, '<td valign="top">I think your going to be a little sick Alan :P<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by alanfreed:</b></div><hr/><i> Another brilliant entry.  If this isn''t the blue ribbon winner, I''ll personally eat all of the rotten pumpkins from the Halloween challenge. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'I think your going to be a little sick Alan :P Originally posted by alanfreed: Another brilliant entry.  If this isn''t the blue ribbon winner, I''ll personally eat all of the rotten pumpkins from the Halloween challenge. ', '2011-11-11 12:53:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6592393, 981771, 29011, '<td valign="top">Sounds like shooting this was surreal. I didn''t vote but this was one of the few that stood out to me. I''ve been on the beach during those sand wiped days but never got a chance to capture it. Nice to know this was a single frame. May I ask how did you capture or add blueish tint to the ground? lens filter, color balance etc.?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-11-11 12:55:14.</i></td>', 'Sounds like shooting this was surreal. I didn''t vote but this was one of the few that stood out to me. I''ve been on the beach during those sand wiped days but never got a chance to capture it. Nice to know this was a single frame. May I ask how did you capture or add blueish tint to the ground? lens filter, color balance etc.?', '2011-11-11 12:54:49.000000', '2011-11-11 12:55:14.000000', 0),
(6592399, 982191, 29011, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed. The smoke in shape of the skull is my favorite part. I see a mustache, not by any chance a growing prop for Movember? ;)</td>', 'Nicely executed. The smoke in shape of the skull is my favorite part. I see a mustache, not by any chance a growing prop for Movember? ;)', '2011-11-11 13:08:42.000000', NULL, 0),
