(6592450, 982191, 77196, '<td valign="top">So much to love about this image! Who''d''a thunk that 8.16 would only get you red? Congratulations on a great image. This goes so far beyond the visual aspects, and scrapes its talons across the soul...<br/></td>', 'So much to love about this image! Who''d''a thunk that 8.16 would only get you red? Congratulations on a great image. This goes so far beyond the visual aspects, and scrapes its talons across the soul...', '2011-11-11 15:18:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6592451, 982240, 16106, '<td valign="top">A softer brush to keep the edges on the cat from being so crisp will make him blend in a bit more. Here is a quick tutorial for <a href="//help.adobe.com/en_US/photoshop/cs/using/WSfd1234e1c4b69f30ea53e41001031ab64-76e2a.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">PS</a> but if you are using another program look at "feather edges". Judi did a masterful job of feathering in and matching color densities in her wining entry. The bones of this entry are very good, a few technical changes would have pushed it further up the placings.</td>', 'A softer brush to keep the edges on the cat from being so crisp will make him blend in a bit more. Here is a quick tutorial for PS but if you are using another program look at "feather edges". Judi did a masterful job of feathering in and matching color densities in her wining entry. The bones of this entry are very good, a few technical changes would have pushed it further up the placings.', '2011-11-11 15:19:08.000000', NULL, 0),
