(6592661, 982191, 37845, '<td valign="top">Highest Scoring red on DPC. Brilliant image Christophe.</td>', 'Highest Scoring red on DPC. Brilliant image Christophe.', '2011-11-11 20:19:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6592718, 982191, 38032, '<td valign="top">The amount of thought and planning - and discovery you put into this stuff is inspiring. I can only hope that others will appreciate it and aspire to such an attitude. So many people seem to get a decent camera and that is pretty much all the effort they put in - you are the antithesis of that.<br/>So awesome.<br/></td>', 'The amount of thought and planning - and discovery you put into this stuff is inspiring. I can only hope that others will appreciate it and aspire to such an attitude. So many people seem to get a decent camera and that is pretty much all the effort they put in - you are the antithesis of that.So awesome.', '2011-11-11 22:59:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6592722, 982123, 28742, '<td valign="top">What - I was your only 10?? Well I had this pegged for a ribbon. Clearly a conspiracy. :) Congrats on an awesome image anyway!</td>', 'What - I was your only 10?? Well I had this pegged for a ribbon. Clearly a conspiracy. :) Congrats on an awesome image anyway!', '2011-11-11 23:20:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(6592723, 982191, 28742, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/gyaban_congrats2.png'', strrpos(''//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/gyaban_congrats2.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/gyaban_congrats2.png"/> <br/> <br/>I''ll spare you the monotony of calling you Brilliant. ;-)</td>', '  I''ll spare you the monotony of calling you Brilliant. ;-)', '2011-11-11 23:23:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6592725, 981573, 28742, '<td valign="top">My favorite part of this is how you make the SC spend a month trying to validate. ;-)<br/> <br/>Congrats, Red! Your skills with the camera AND on the computer are inspirational! And look at that score! Someday you may even beat <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=106" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this gem</a>. :)</td>', 'My favorite part of this is how you make the SC spend a month trying to validate. ;-) Congrats, Red! Your skills with the camera AND on the computer are inspirational! And look at that score! Someday you may even beat this gem. :)', '2011-11-11 23:27:42.000000', NULL, 0),
