(6592752, 981573, 75713, '<td valign="top">Congratulations - and thank you for including how many photos you used, the amount of each type and for giving my eyes a journey that is filled with such beauty.</td>', 'Congratulations - and thank you for including how many photos you used, the amount of each type and for giving my eyes a journey that is filled with such beauty.', '2011-11-12 00:37:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6592753, 982191, 75713, '<td valign="top">I wonder where you will end up professionally - creating one of a kind prints for a high end art gallery .. working with famous writers to create the cover that will add thousands to their client list .. creating a cover for a famous band promoting the creativity of their new sound? We will be reading about you for sure. Congratulations.</td>', 'I wonder where you will end up professionally - creating one of a kind prints for a high end art gallery .. working with famous writers to create the cover that will add thousands to their client list .. creating a cover for a famous band promoting the creativity of their new sound? We will be reading about you for sure. Congratulations.', '2011-11-12 00:40:44.000000', NULL, 0),
