(7318856, 982139, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ja-9:</b></div><hr/><i> this is amazing Paul...I really wish you would explain how you got the eyes and nose in this...stunning </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ah, OK (I''m a bit late here). I just photographed a real-life (or death) skull I have laying around the house. I used to use it for teaching. Just a case of painting the layer through then and a bit of ''liquefy'' to get it to look right.</td>', 'Originally posted by Ja-9: this is amazing Paul...I really wish you would explain how you got the eyes and nose in this...stunning   Ah, OK (I''m a bit late here). I just photographed a real-life (or death) skull I have laying around the house. I used to use it for teaching. Just a case of painting the layer through then and a bit of ''liquefy'' to get it to look right.', '2015-02-20 08:43:37.000000', NULL, 0);
